Package: sorenR
Title: Reference Maps with Certified Bounded Updates
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fits self-organizing representations with evolving
    neighborhoods (SOREN): a prototype codebook laid out by stress
    majorization, with a deterministic out-of-sample map in pure R. A fitted
    map can take new batches without existing prototypes moving in input
    space; new prototypes are appended only where observations fall outside
    conformally calibrated support, and layout coordinates stay within a
    fixed lifetime radius. This bounds how far any observation, seen or
    unseen, can move between map versions, and the originally fitted map
    stays exactly reproducible from every updated model. The approach is
    experimental and has not been validated on real data.
